ISLAND | B | main | 48 | 39 | 18 | 8.5 | 0 | 12 | village lobe (south-east, low): farms, fountain plaza, the goal chapel
ISLAND | P | main | 48 | 16.5 | 18 | 12.5 | 10 | 16 | plateau (north-east, high): the cathedral library, the pale grove, the river
ISLAND | L | link | 28 | 23 | 6 | 6 | 5 | 6 | shoulder: the stepped, cliffy ramp from the forest up to the plateau
ISLAND | L2 | link | 60 | 29.5 | 3.5 | 4 | 5 | 6 | east shoulder: the stepped ramp from the plateau down to the village lobe (the picture shows a path descending here)

