# ---- buildings (masses only; interiors and details are later layers)
BUILD | cathedral | library-cathedral | 46 | 8 | 14 | 8 | 10 | 16 | steep-hip | THE landmark: pale stone, long nave east-west, a central tower and six smaller spires with green copper roofs, buttresses, a front door facing south. The library interior (reading rooms, shelves, a sofa corner) is inside.
