BUILD | east_stair | stairs | 59 | 27 | 2 | 5 | 0 | 10 | ramp | the long stair on the east shoulder, from the plateau (10) to the village lobe (0), waypoints 12 to 13
BUILD | bridge | footbridge | 43 | 17 | 4 | 2 | 10 | 1 | flat | the small stone/timber bridge over the plateau river, between waypoints 8 and 9
